# Commands Viva

### Create virtual environment:

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
```

---

### Activate virtual environment:

Mac/Linux:

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

Windows:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

---

### Install requirements:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

### Run Flask app:

```bash
python3 main.py
```

---

### Deploy application:

```bash
gcloud app deploy
```

---

### Open deployed app:

```bash
gcloud app browse
```

---

### Set project ID:

```bash
gcloud config set project PROJECT_ID
```

---

